#. ~ Description of variant "wolf tactical jacket" of item "tactical jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Subtle and unassuming, save for the purely ludicrous number of pockets it's "
"coated in, this hardy overgarment's outer shell is dyed a muted tone of gray "
"verging into beige."
msgstr ""

